'''Torrid''' is an {{Rarity|e|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
'''Torrid''' can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level XV (15)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Torrid''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|5%|1|20|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked.

